From 0d22600eedd95283868ab2dd8da9932c78ff3b7d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AUTH-01 Native Convergence <auth01-agent@local>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 20:00:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/11] fix(auth): converge native buyer login with governed
 preflight

- Add buyer-preflight.ts: calls buyer-login-gateway (Central) before any
  OTP, fails closed on transport/parse failure.
- Add buyer-identity.ts: normalization ported from Central's auth-identity.ts.
- Add buyer-identity-claim.ts: wraps the CURRENT (20260914160000) dual
  verified-identifier claim_approved_b2b_access_request_v2 RPC.
- Add buyer-session-bridge.ts: MSG91 access-token -> token_hash ->
  supabase.auth.verifyOtp -> claim, mirroring Central's verifiedProviderSession.
- Add msg91-otp-widget.ts: native OTP transport via the official
  @msg91comm/sendotp-react-native SDK. Only client-safe widgetId/tokenAuth
  are embedded (same class of credential Central already embeds in its own
  web bundle) -- provider authkey and all provider verification stay
  server-side in msg91-otp / msg91-email-session (Central edge functions).
- Rewrite LoginScreen.tsx: Mobile OTP and Email OTP only. Google OAuth and
  the broken email magic-link path are removed entirely, not just disabled.
  Every path is preflight-gated before OTP.
- Rewrite RegisterScreen.tsx: fully unauthenticated, calls
  submit_b2b_access_request_v2 with its exact current signature. No city
  field -- no canonical column/param exists.
- Rewrite resolveBuyerSession(): removed order-draft probing and
  AsyncStorage-based inference entirely. Deleted application-status-storage.ts.
  New fail-closed 'no_membership' state.
- Update session-routing.ts, Access screens, navigation types, BuyerGate.
- Fix ProductDetailScreen gating: capability-level, not page-level.
- Sync RPC allowlist / boundary verifier / database.types.ts.
- tsconfig.json: node_modules exclude + paths shim for the MSG91 package.

Verified: npm run quality (boundary, rc-scan, rc-nav, typecheck, lint,
test [130/130], census:p106, expo config) passes end to end. No production
mutation.
